doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22172533"
license: "CC-BY-NC-ND-4.0"
abstract: >-
  DSG Spacetime is customer-hosted governance infrastructure for AI agents.
  It provides node-to-node capability discovery and composition, plan-bound
  execution, deployment-bound commercial entitlements, fail-closed governance,
  and verifiable evidence while allowing existing customer systems to remain
  in their own infrastructure.
